#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Options for state-plotting functions {#options-for-state-plotting-functions}"
msgstr "Opsi untuk fungsi plot state {#options-for-state-plotting-functions}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"All state-plotting functions accept the following arguments (except the LaTeX drawer, which doesn't return a Matplotlib figure, and `plot_state_qsphere`, which only accepts **figsize**):\n"
"- **title** (str): a string for the plot title, displayed at the top of the plot\n"
"- **figsize** (tuple): figure size in inches (width, height)\n"
msgstr ""
"Semua fungsi plot state menerima argumen berikut (kecuali drawer LaTeX, yang tidak mengembalikan figure Matplotlib, dan `plot_state_qsphere`, yang hanya menerima **figsize**):\n"
"- **title** (str): string untuk judul plot, ditampilkan di bagian atas plot\n"
"- **figsize** (tuple): ukuran figure dalam inci (lebar, tinggi)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The `plot_state_city` and `plot_state_paulivec` functions also accept a **color** argument (list of strings) specifying the colors of the bars. See the [API documentation](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/visualization) for more information.\n"
msgstr "Fungsi `plot_state_city` dan `plot_state_paulivec` juga menerima argumen **color** (list string) yang menentukan warna batang. Lihat [dokumentasi API](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/visualization) untuk informasi lebih lanjut.\n"

